"asb" = (
/obj/structure/table/reinforced/plastitaniumglass,
/obj/machinery/fax{
	name = "DS-2 Fax Machine";
	pixel_y = 7
	},
/obj/item/paper{
	name = "lost diary entry";
	default_raw_text = "The radar pings are nearly every day. What are they searching for? Us? They shouldn't know we're here. Have we been sending too many sorties? Have I not been careful enough? Is it too late to even do anything to save ourselves? \n I'd never tell the rest of the crew, but we can't win a head-on fight. We just can't. We can fight to our last, make them work for it, make them bleed for it, but we can't take a straight-up fight no matter how confident everyone is. We just can't. There's too many of them, too little of us, and they have far more resources to work with than us. \n It's gonna be like this over and over and over again. I get comfortable, I make friends, we make some kind of progress against NT. And then they find us. They kick the doors down. And we scatter. Why do I even let myself get comfortable? It hurts so much to break that comfort, and I know it's coming. I hurt too much already because of them to take more pain. \n I guess if I never got comfortable, I wouldn't have found you, love. That's easily worth it. \n \n Goodnight."
	},
/obj/effect/decal/cleanable/dirt,
/turf/open/floor/iron/dark/textured_half,
/area/ruin/space/has_grav/nova/des_two/bridge)
